					"nextDialogs": [
						402130102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「准尉」"
				},
				{
					"id": 402130102,
					"content": "不用查了，帶著你的人回來，重新接管這座設施。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402130103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「大尉」"
				},
				{
					"id": 402130103,
					"content": "不用查…這是上頭的意思？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402130104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「准尉」"
				},
				{
					"id": 402130104,
					"content": "不用查了，明白嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402130105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「大尉」"
				},
				{
					"id": 402130105,
					"content": "明白了，大尉！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402130106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「准尉」"
				},
				{
					"id": 402130106,
					"content": "嗯？你們什麼時候到這裡來的？這裡是月矩力試驗設計局名下的設施，無關人等請盡快離開。",
